243
00:15:09,080 --> 00:15:13,080
and then use the shift key in the upper left corner of the 3D window to start the depth map.

244
00:15:13,080 --> 00:15:16,080
Then simulate the clothing to activate the depth map.

245
00:15:16,080 --> 00:15:19,080
Different from the previous version of the depth map,

246
00:15:19,080 --> 00:15:22,080
the strength of the depth map is reflected on the surface of the virtual model.

247
00:15:22,080 --> 00:15:24,080
Therefore, when you directly click on the surface of the virtual model,

248
00:15:24,080 --> 00:15:26,080
the strength of the pressure will be displayed,

249
00:15:26,080 --> 00:15:29,080
and the area where the clothes are not affected is displayed as 0.

250
00:15:29,080 --> 00:15:32,080
If you want to check the pressure value of the clothing in the area,

251
00:15:32,080 --> 00:15:36,080
click on the Control key on Windows PC and click on Clothes.

252
00:15:36,080 --> 00:15:39,080
As for the display lock added to the mouse light,

253
00:15:39,080 --> 00:15:42,080
you can display the pressure value of the virtual model in the area,

254
00:15:42,080 --> 00:15:47,080
and click on CMD key and click on CMD key on the Mac OS.

255
00:15:47,080 --> 00:15:50,080
In the new 2025.0 version,

256
00:15:50,080 --> 00:15:53,080
if you drag the clothing during the simulation process,

257
00:15:53,080 --> 00:15:56,080
the color of the part of the virtual model will change.

258
00:15:56,080 --> 00:15:59,080
If you want to know the pressure value of the part,

259
00:15:59,080 --> 00:16:04,080
you can stop the simulation and click on the Control key to check.

260
00:16:04,080 --> 00:16:09,080
We hope that the new improvement method can accurately express the pressure area

261
00:16:09,080 --> 00:16:11,080
and improve the accuracy of the version modification,

262
00:16:11,080 --> 00:16:15,080
thereby optimizing your digital clothing design and try-on process.

